# The Bird of Prey fight of shield.play with the four Birds of Prey of team 1 ordered onto A1, shot every 0.15 seconds:
# hits on high shields show a green shield hit effect, hits on shields that run down show an orange and then a red one,
# and A2, whose shield generator is destroyed, shows the white shield-down overlay. Run it with --map kling4; the
# README, "Run a play script", has the command.
scroll down 20
hold Down 1
hold Up 0.19
scroll up 16
hold Down 0.1
wait 0.2
select Bop1M
attack A1
select Bop2M
attack A1
shot e-01
wait 0.15
shot e-02
wait 0.15
shot e-03
wait 0.15
shot e-04
wait 0.15
shot e-05
wait 0.15
shot e-06
wait 0.15
shot e-07
wait 0.15
shot e-08
wait 0.15
shot e-09
wait 0.15
shot e-10
wait 0.15
shot e-11
wait 0.15
shot e-12
wait 0.15
shot e-13
wait 0.15
shot e-14
wait 0.15
shot e-15
wait 0.15
shot e-16
wait 0.15
shot e-17
wait 0.15
shot e-18
wait 0.15
shot e-19
wait 0.15
